# One class per file

When adding or refactoring types, put each primary class, enum, or Protocol in its own file.

- Name the file after the type in snake_case (Python).
- Do not add a second unrelated class to an existing type file.

Enforced for `api/**/*.py` by `tools/lint/pythonOneClassPerFile.py`.
